title: "edit-recreator: recreate short-form video edits frame by frame in Remotion with your own footage"
abstract: "A Claude Code plugin and skill that measures a reference video edit (cuts, transitions, retiming, framing, text) and rebuilds it in Remotion with new footage, verified frame by frame against the reference."
